<html xmlns:o='urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office' xmlns:w='urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:word' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/TR/REC-html40'><head><meta http-equiv="Content-Type" content="text/html; charset=utf-8" /><!--[if gte mso 9]><xml><w:WordDocument><w:View>Print</w:View><w:Zoom>100</w:Zoom><w:DoNotOptimizeForBrowser/></w:WordDocument></xml><![endif]--><style>@page WordSection1 {size:297mm 210mm;margin:12.7mm;mso-page-orientation:landscape;}div.WordSection1 {page:WordSection1;}table {border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;}th, td {padding:8px;text-align:center;}th {font-weight:bold;}thead {display:table-header-group;}tr {page-break-inside:avoid;}a {text-decoration:none none;}</style></head><body lang='uz-Cyrl-UZ'><div class=WordSection1><table border=1><thead><tr><th>Т/р</th><th>Ҳужжат реквизитлари</th><th>Ҳужжат номи</th><th>Кучга кириш санаси</th><th>Ҳужжат ҳаволаси</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>1</td><td>321,<br />03.04.1997&nbsp;й.</td><td>Ўзбекистон Республикасида юкларни транспортда ташиш , газ етказиш, алоқа хизмати ва тожикистон республикасининг давлат қарзларига хизмат кўрсатиш бўйича ўзаро ҳисоб-китобларини амалга ошириш тартиби</td><td>03.04.1997&nbsp;й.</td><td><a href="http://lex.uz/docs/1082552">http://lex.uz/docs/1082552</a></td></tr></tbody></table></div></body></html>